+  <div class="trust-label-wrap"><a class="trust-label trust-label--broken" href="../museum-map.html#trust-labels" title="Cryptographically broken — historically important but unsafe to use today." aria-label="Trust label: Broken. Cryptographically broken — historically important but unsafe to use today."><svg class="trust-label__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 7.5-2"/></svg><span class="trust-label__text">Broken</span></a></div>
+  <p class="page-tagline">Four turns, one complete grid: a stencil that scrambles the message instead of hiding it</p>
+  <p class="exhibit-status-note">A transposition cipher: quarter-turn holes permute a complete block, preserving letter frequencies.</p>
