+        <div class="input-group"><label class="input-label" for="grille-size">Grid size</label><select class="museum-input" id="grille-size"><option value="4">4 × 4</option><option value="6">6 × 6</option><option value="8">8 × 8</option></select></div><p class="historical-grid-caption">Click a cell to move its orbit’s hole there. The other three cells in that orbit remain covered in the starting mask. The demo always keeps a valid grille.</p><div class="btn-group"><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="grille-reset">Reset hole pattern</button></div><p class="historical-grid-caption">Starting holes (zero-based row-major): <span id="grille-key"></span></p>
